{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 2596,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a robot that walks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2596,
    "dDurationMs": 1864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "flies, "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4460,
    "dDurationMs": 1515,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "skateboards,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5975,
    "dDurationMs": 1845,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and slacklines. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7820,
    "dDurationMs": 1888,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10610,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A portion of this video was sponsored by Bluehost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12460,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More about them at the end of the show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15240,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are lots of\nbipedal robots out there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17520,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and drones are ubiquitous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19890,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But until now, no one had engineered"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22520,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "walking and flying\ntechnology to work together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25930,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a single robot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27260,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So it's the first robot\nthat truly integrates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29940,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the walking and the flying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31390,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not just a drone with legs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34680,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Dr. Chung] It's\nLEONARDO and it stands for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37470,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LEgs ONboARD drOne."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39840,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think it's a pretty good name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41340,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Why is this potentially useful?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43670,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, so any flying vehicles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45630,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually have to start from\nthe ground to take off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47960,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And eventually, they can\nnot stay in the air forever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50840,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have to eventually come down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52550,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But sometimes they have to come down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54130,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the very challenging\nterrain or some obstacles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57700,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's actually a good idea to have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59660,
    "dDurationMs": 1649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these controlLable legs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61309,
    "dDurationMs": 1011,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they can actually land"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62320,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a very interesting configuration,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65210,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or posture, or orientation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67660,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] But there are\nadditional benefits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69630,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A robot like this is more\nstable than a regular drone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72950,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I view these propellers\nalmost like arms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75780,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So some people might say that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76960,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oh, you guys are cheating because I mean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78890,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bipedal robots do not have propellers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81080,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but we are essentially\nusing the propellers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83070,
    "dDurationMs": 1983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do additional stabilization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86166,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(robot whirring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92061,
    "dDurationMs": 2779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So basically, you generate\nthe lift or thruster force"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94840,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to cancel some of the\nthe weight of the robot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98770,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's really a secondary factor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100760,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most important thing is basically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102410,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "posture or orientation, stabilization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104971,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(robot whirring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110539,
    "dDurationMs": 2181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] That is so cool to see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112720,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So the main facility for this lab"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115350,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is this one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116570,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a gigantic fan array."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118930,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] I can see all the fans now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120320,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Dr. Chung] Yeah, we have\n- you can start counting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122130,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but 1,296 computer fans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125260,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those are really literally computer fans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127110,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] How fast can it generate wind?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129340,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So up to 15 meters per\nsecond or 20 meters per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132600,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] It's like a wind tunnel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133433,
    "dDurationMs": 1217,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without the need for a tunnel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134650,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135483,
    "dDurationMs": 2047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It might mess with our\naudio or with our microphones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137530,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139100,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The idea of the smoke machines"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140550,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to actually visualize the flow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142970,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also with all these\nadditional sensors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145140,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like infrared cameras or radar and LIDAR,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147760,
    "dDurationMs": 2304,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how we can actually figure\nout the kind of location"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150064,
    "dDurationMs": 2616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or environment around your vehicle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152680,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the presence of this fog."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156000,
    "dDurationMs": 2842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] I wanted to feel\ntheir power for myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158842,
    "dDurationMs": 1282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Man] All right, you ready?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160124,
    "dDurationMs": 3008,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Yeah, let's do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163132,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(machine whirring loudly)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173280,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174920,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was so cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176520,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I love it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178170,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They use this facility to test Leonardo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180420,
    "dDurationMs": 3483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to see how stable he is even\nin different wind conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185543,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(orchestral music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196430,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And we showed that Leo\nis more robust than a drone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199700,
    "dDurationMs": 1761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because a drone gets\nblown away by the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201461,
    "dDurationMs": 2989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then Leo does not because\nof its ground contact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204450,
    "dDurationMs": 1907,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for example, if you go\nhiking and there's like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206357,
    "dDurationMs": 2613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "suddenly a lot of wind,\nyou're not gonna fall"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208970,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you have the ground contact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211660,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for a drone, it might be blown away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213860,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(gentle soft orchestra music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228469,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(robot whirring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230310,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Man] Oh no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234480,
    "dDurationMs": 2277,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So we actually took\none of the whiteboards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236757,
    "dDurationMs": 2673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we have at home and we put oil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239430,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we applied perturbations to Leo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241460,
    "dDurationMs": 3755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what's happening is as you\npush Leo, instead of falling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245215,
    "dDurationMs": 4555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it stays upright, but it also\nslides on the white board."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249770,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's an interesting capability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251340,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's very robust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252680,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You said perturbations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253920,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you poking the robot?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255780,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes, without harming the robot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257270,
    "dDurationMs": 1386,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are gentle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258656,
    "dDurationMs": 2354,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(robot whirring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261010,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- LEONARDO is so stable and\ngood at adjusting its balance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264510,
    "dDurationMs": 1463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it can skateboard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267013,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(robot whirring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275020,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a fancy trick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277490,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not many people can go\nbackwards on a skateboard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281290,
    "dDurationMs": 2357,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did you get the idea for\na robot that will skateboard?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283647,
    "dDurationMs": 2823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Should I say the truth\nor make a nice story?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286470,
    "dDurationMs": 1130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Tell us the truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287600,
    "dDurationMs": 2475,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, so we went hiking and we saw"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290075,
    "dDurationMs": 3615,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about 10 people going down\nthe mountain on a skateboard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293690,
    "dDurationMs": 1575,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we thought,\nwow, this is really cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295265,
    "dDurationMs": 2926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if we try our robots\nto make it do this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298191,
    "dDurationMs": 3439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we went to the first shop\nand we bought a skateboard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301630,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We modified it and we\ntried it and it worked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304320,
    "dDurationMs": 1153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So do you\nthink it allows the robot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305473,
    "dDurationMs": 2617,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to save energy by riding on a skateboard?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308090,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's more efficient because\nit uses the legs less."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311580,
    "dDurationMs": 1738,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The legs are basically used to steer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313318,
    "dDurationMs": 1772,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it's just the propellors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315090,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are used to accelerate the skateboard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317060,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forward and backwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317900,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So yeah, it makes it\nsave a bit more energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321190,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The propellors of\ncourse, make it possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323150,
    "dDurationMs": 1557,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to skateboard backwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324707,
    "dDurationMs": 2413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something I struggled with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327120,
    "dDurationMs": 2777,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It definitely would help\nif I had a propeller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329897,
    "dDurationMs": 2917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(woman chattering)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333760,
    "dDurationMs": 3004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the real challenge was slacklining."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336764,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat latino dance music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343460,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This looks incredibly unstable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345450,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think this proves\nthe point of just like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348470,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how important control systems are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350610,
    "dDurationMs": 3243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can tell from the footage\nI have no idea what I'm doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354898,
    "dDurationMs": 1842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Derek shrieks)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356740,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, I thought I would\nbe slightly better at that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359570,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's give it another shot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362240,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364810,
    "dDurationMs": 1563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can anyone slackline?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372140,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373070,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is impossible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374500,
    "dDurationMs": 2236,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need a robot to do this for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376736,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat latino dance music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382717,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(robot whirring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390260,
    "dDurationMs": 2123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like the sidestepping technique."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393260,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe I should have been doing that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397789,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kind of like copy his technique."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405470,
    "dDurationMs": 3224,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I tried to get some tips\nby watching Leonardo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408694,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(robot whirring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415100,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But improvement was negligible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421980,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I should've prepared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424320,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might think it's\ncheating to use propellers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426610,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the robot is clearly not flying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429350,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is supporting itself\nmostly using the rope,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431870,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's able to stabilize itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433870,
    "dDurationMs": 1713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even with the wild bouncing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437140,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So human professional slack liner,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438890,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see some of their videos,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440850,
    "dDurationMs": 1817,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually they use arms stretched"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442667,
    "dDurationMs": 1981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they can balance themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444648,
    "dDurationMs": 2452,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We don't have the arms for LEO yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447100,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are planning to add a manipulation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449220,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that he can actually carry some object."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451630,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in the meantime, we\nare using the propellers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454100,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to stabilize LEO while he's actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456470,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "walking on a slackline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458120,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's funny because\nlike the robot feels like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460960,
    "dDurationMs": 1473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's got kind of a personality to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462433,
    "dDurationMs": 2827,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way it walks and flies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465260,
    "dDurationMs": 2446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just totally something\nyou're not used to seeing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467706,
    "dDurationMs": 974,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It looks natural."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468680,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, I have to say that the sensors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471100,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are sampled at 1,000 times per second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473500,
    "dDurationMs": 3165,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the controller is\nactually being recomputed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476665,
    "dDurationMs": 1495,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whatever signal you are sending"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478160,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to propellers and the leg\njoints is 200 times per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481840,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's pretty fast computation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484350,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] 200 times a second\nit is adjusting what it's doing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487650,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to maintain balance?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488580,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes, especially\npropeller control signal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491020,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How does that compare to humans?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493030,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh, humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494280,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So humans can do very sophisticated tasks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497440,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in terms of a fast reaction,\nit's a very crude machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501210,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So humans, overall, has\na few seconds of delay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505490,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Time delay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506330,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Is this why I was\nstruggling on the slackline?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508190,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Maybe, but... (chuckles)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510270,
    "dDurationMs": 2165,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] How do you feel about\nthe performance here today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512435,
    "dDurationMs": 1211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, I think it beat you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513646,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Derek laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515116,
    "dDurationMs": 1384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I mean, not that that's hard,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516500,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this is very impressive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518380,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you imagine a robot like\nLEONARDO in the future,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521300,
    "dDurationMs": 2983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the greatest LEONARDO you could make,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524283,
    "dDurationMs": 3877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what would that robot look like and do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528160,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So definitely having a\nLEO-like robot in space,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531890,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would be amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533370,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But of course, depending on where you go,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535420,
    "dDurationMs": 1663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you might not be able to use propellers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537083,
    "dDurationMs": 2577,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then you would need to use thrusters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539660,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So eventually, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540493,
    "dDurationMs": 4077,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We want to develop this\nleg-based adaptive landing gear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544570,
    "dDurationMs": 2999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we give that to next\ngeneration Mars helicopter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547569,
    "dDurationMs": 2691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or next generation flying cars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550260,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that it can actually land"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552179,
    "dDurationMs": 2381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in very challenging conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554560,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And still move around once-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555601,
    "dDurationMs": 1749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And then once, yeah, once you land,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557350,
    "dDurationMs": 1136,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you can walk over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558486,
    "dDurationMs": 3514,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(robot whirring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562000,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Imagine if you have a cliff\nand then you have the robot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564990,
    "dDurationMs": 3943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just jump out of the cliff,\ndeploy the propellers and fly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570220,
    "dDurationMs": 1738,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] That'd be wild."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571958,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(quirky sound effect)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577420,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, hey there."
    } ]
